Current Version can be found [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Explosion here].
Explosion started as 7G with the effect to deal 2 DMG to an enemy monster of your choice. Monsters adjacent to it (so directly left and right) will take 4 DMG. '''Beta 7.4''' gave it its first change, which was an updated image, making Explosion one of the first cards to do so. '''Beta 9.3''' gave it its first balance change, a -1 cost drop from 7G to 6G.

'''Beta 15.0''' brought it back to 7G, but also reworked the effect a bit. Now, it deals 4 damage to any monster of your choice instead of 2 limited to enemy monsters. But the adjacent monsters, while still taking 4 damage, will only take damage if the targeted monster is killed with this. '''Beta 18.1''' dropped its cost back to 6. '''Beta 22.0''' nerfed its effect a bit by only dealing 3 damage to adjacent monsters.

=== Stats ===
SOUL Type: Justice

Cost:
* 7 (Post Alpha 3.0)
* 6 (Post Beta  9.3)
* 7 (Post Beta 15.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 18.1, Current)
Effects:
* Deal 2 DMG to an enemy monster and 4 DMG to adjacent ones. (Post Alpha 3.0)
* Deal 4 DMG to a monster. Kill: Deal 4 DMG to adjacent ones. (Post Beta 15.0)
* Deal 4 DMG to a monster. Kill: Deal 3 DMG to adjacent ones. (Post Beta 22.0, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
